  m_text: "<size=110><color=#FFD64A>FIM</color></size>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<size=38><color=#FFD64A>SAPO
    WILSON\nE AS MA\xC7\xC3S DOURADAS</color></size>\n\n\n<color=#FFD64A>DESENVOLVIDO
    POR</color>\nJo\xE3o Vitor Camargo\n\n<color=#FFD64A>DISCIPLINA</color>\nDesenvolvimento
    de Jogos Digitais\nCi\xEAncia da Computa\xE7\xE3o \u2014 USC\n\n<color=#FFD64A>AGRADECIMENTO
    ESPECIAL</color>\nAo professor Luis Filipe Grael Tinos,\npelas aulas e pela orienta\xE7\xE3o\nao
    longo do desenvolvimento.\n\n\n<color=#FFD64A>ARTE E CEN\xC1RIOS</color>\nPixel
    Adventure \u2014 Pixel Frog\nMountains Tileset and Backgrounds \u2014 karsiori\nDragon
    Warrior\n2D Mega Pack \u2014 Brackeys\nFree Platform Game Assets \u2014 Bayat
    Games\n2D Cartoon Parallax Background\n\n<color=#FFD64A>FONTE</color>\nPress
    Start 2P\n\n\n<color=#FFD64A>M\xDASICAS E EFEITOS SONOROS</color>\nTodos obtidos
    em pixabay.com\n\n<color=#FFD64A>AUTORES DOS \xC1UDIOS</color>\n666herohero\nalex-morgan\nalice_soundz\ncomposiia\ndennish18\ndominic251\ndragon-studio\nedr\nemand_edroff\nfreesound_community\nlesiakower\nliecio\nnickpanek\nsound_garage\nsunspellauditory\nuniversfield\n\n\n<color=#FFD64A>FEITO
    COM UNITY</color>\n\n\n<size=34><color=#FFD64A>OBRIGADO POR JOGAR!</color></size>"
